- **Minimum alarm interval** (§5): not explicitly documented in any page I fetched; I labeled the second-granularity guidance as inference.
- **`c.req.raw` in §3:** standard Hono API, but I did not fetch the Hono `HonoRequest` reference page to pin it; the forwarding pattern itself (`stub.fetch(request)`) is from Cloudflare's docs.
- **`compatibility_flags` specifics:** I only included the verified `nodejs_compat` mention as a commented optional; the full flag catalog lives on the [Compatibility flags](https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/configuration/compatibility-flags/) page, which I did not fetch in full.

